<title>GERMANY: Tietmeyer parliamentary testimony cancelled.</title>
<headline>Tietmeyer parliamentary testimony cancelled.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bundesbank President Hans Tietmeyer will not testify on Thursday before parliament's finance committee as originally scheduled, a committee spokesman said.</p>
<p>The committee changed its agenda and will not be discussing the Bundesbank law, eliminating the need for Tietmeyer to appear, the spokesman said.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-2609750</p>
</text>
